  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCA - The Global Center on Adaptation 2020-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">GCA brings together governments, the private sector, civil society, intergovernmental bodies, and knowledge institutions that can address the obstacles slowing down climate adaptation action.</narrative>
